promptTemplate:
Training objective: {{training_goal}}
Domain context: {{domain_context}}

Derive sourcePlan.contentScope generically from the human objective. It must contain non-empty targets plus boundaries and exclusions arrays. Inspect every retained source and emit contentAssessment with classification target-only, shared-target-applicable or mixed-filtered plus evidence. A mixed-filtered source must contain contentRules. For each clearly bounded out-of-scope section, emit a rule with id, action=exclude-section, unique textual start and later end anchors, optional positive startOccurrence and endOccurrence, optional Boolean caseSensitive, origin=human-explicit or machine-derived, reason and evidence. Preserve shared content that explicitly applies to a target; never use a word blacklist. If required filtering cannot be bounded unambiguously, reject an optional source or return a blocker for a mandatory source.
